256
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,077
Of course I'm sure!

257
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:06,689
Look, he's got a giant axe you
can see for yourself, stupid!

258
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:07,710
Give it up!

259
00:14:07,793 --> 00:14:09,817
You're going to get a red
card if you don't shut it!

260
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:11,617
Why are you siding with
them all of a sudden?

261
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:13,277
We're going to get Julienned out there!

262
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:15,697
I know, but they're trying to
make you do something stupid.

263
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:18,197
If you won't do it for me,
at least do it for Chopper!

264
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:20,680
OK, stand back and let me handle him!

265
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:23,757
No, we don't need the captain
butting in and complicating things!

266
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:24,670
Dungey, please!

267
00:14:24,753 --> 00:14:25,955
Win the match for me!

268
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:27,900
I won't let you down!

269
00:14:29,580 --> 00:14:30,460
That was easy.

270
00:14:31,340 --> 00:14:33,300
All right, now back to the game!

271
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:41,485
If you're gonna do that
again, why even bother?

272
00:14:41,820 --> 00:14:43,937
Running around like this
is getting us nowhere.

273
00:14:44,020 --> 00:14:48,137
Yeah, but now that we know their game
plan, we can come up with a counterattack.

274
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:49,420
Get ready, big man.

275
00:14:49,860 --> 00:14:51,200
It's payback time!

276
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:53,460
Go back to the sidelines.

277
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,840
This bastard is mine!

278
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:58,137
There's plenty of it for the bulk of you!

279
00:14:58,220 --> 00:14:59,700
And they're off!

280
00:14:59,980 --> 00:15:01,804
All three are about to collide!

281
00:15:04,020 --> 00:15:06,432
If I attack him where his skin's exposed,

282
00:15:06,740 --> 00:15:09,564
I'll just end up slipping
around like last time.

283
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:13,308
That leaves his hands, his feet,
his mask, and his underwear.

284
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:24,990
Ow!

285
00:15:25,073 --> 00:15:26,557
Here comes Big Pan's signature move!

286
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:28,660
Things are about to get slippery.

287
00:15:29,340 --> 00:15:30,480
I'll bring it on.

288
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:32,917
Who's afraid of a little skating, right?

289
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,420
No, there's no escape.

290
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:36,760
I'm going to lose my life. Come on.

291
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:38,057
Do it together, guys.

292
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:38,970
Really?

293
00:15:39,053 --> 00:15:41,137
It looks like Pickles and Hattberg have

294
00:15:41,220 --> 00:15:43,437
finally recovered from
their earlier accident.

295
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:44,877
Yeah, they're back in it.

296
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,195
Slaughter them, guys.

297
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:47,477
And what's this?

298
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:50,037
It seems that they've
updated their wardrobe.

299
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:53,217
Their leader, Hattberg, is sporting
some iron knuckles and elbow guards.

300
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:54,517
Where did those come from?

301
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:58,020
Meanwhile, Pickles has dawned
Spike's shoulder protectors.

302
00:15:58,140 --> 00:16:00,557
Those clearly violate the no-weapons rule.

303
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:05,117
But by complete coincidence, the referee
seems to be doing some stretches right now.

304
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:08,757
Oh, well, you can't expect him
to catch up or anything, right?

305
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,670
What?

306
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:13,657
Time for revenge, my
friend, you ready? The

307
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:20,740
scrappy

308
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:29,817
monster

309
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:31,017
spawns a counterattack,

310
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:32,897
but this time their
target isn't the Ballman?

311
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:34,257
but his partner, Zoro!

312
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:35,477
This is about to get ugly!

313
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:36,840
HAMBURGER HEAVEN!

314
00:16:37,220 --> 00:16:38,220
HAMBURGER HEAVEN!

315
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:43,390
NO!

316
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,430
SORROW!

317
00:16:44,700 --> 00:16:46,417
But the assault isn't over yet!

318
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:49,140
It pan-readies yet another brutal attack!

319
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:51,457
Hamburg is brandishing his mighty elbow

320
00:16:51,540 --> 00:16:54,157
guards and preparing for
an ant-a-crown strike!

321
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,720
Oh, no! This is bad.

322
00:16:56,300 --> 00:16:59,594
The Straw Hats are about to
learn the power of teamwork!

323
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:05,860
Like an arrow running from the sky! Huh?

324
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:08,400
Haunt attack!

325
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:22,990
No!

326
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:25,420
The rat cat?

327
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,397
He won't be walking that one off.

328
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:30,937
By the way, fatalities are a common
occurrence in the groggy ring,

329
00:17:31,020 --> 00:17:31,997
in case you didn't know.

330
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:32,980
So dizzy.

331
00:17:33,300 --> 00:17:37,157
And now the Foxy team turns their
attention to the straw-hack ballman!

332
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:38,980
You got...

333
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:40,770
Cannon!

334
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:44,749
Pickles and his spikes
are closing in fast!

335
00:17:45,220 --> 00:17:46,840
Sanchi! Move!

336
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,520
Spring tackle!

337
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,070
What?

338
00:17:53,153 --> 00:17:53,997
You thought that was it?

339
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:55,786
They're just getting started!

340
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,310
Attack?

341
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:01,100
Shepard sends them flying back.

342
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:03,809
They don't even care
about scoring anymore.

343
00:18:11,020 --> 00:18:13,777
The Craggy Monster stopped the competition

344
00:18:13,860 --> 00:18:16,566
flat with a spectacular
three-man team attack.

345
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:19,280
Such a cruel way to win.

346
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,780
Get up, Zoro.

347
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:24,220
Come on, Sanji.

348
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:29,257
Both balls are still in play,

349
00:18:29,340 --> 00:18:32,277
but it looks like Team Straw
Hat is down for the count.

350
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,190
It's a kick.

351
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:36,580
In fact, you might say they're...

352
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:41,677
Now all that's left is to stuff
the ball man in his coffin.

353
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:42,590
I mean, goal.

354
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:46,020
And it'll be two wins in a
row for the Foxy Pirates.

355
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:50,080
It just goes to show you can't
keep a good monster down.

356
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,980
Looks like we win again.

357
00:18:56,460 --> 00:19:01,020
Hey, let's work together for ten seconds.

358
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:05,440
Okay, fine.

359
00:19:06,280 --> 00:19:07,680
But no longer.

360
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:11,440
Hey, wait, look.

361
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,160
They're out!

362
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:17,555
Against all odds The straw
hats are back on their feet.

363
00:19:18,140 --> 00:19:20,197
Even after a demoralizing beatdown!

364
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:22,897
The swordsman without his
swords, and the seven-ship!

365
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:25,377
Stand tall in the face
of adversity once again!

366
00:19:25,460 --> 00:19:26,290
Yeah!

367
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:28,520
You guys!

368
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:30,921
Why you gotta scare me like that?

369
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:36,441
The question is, even if they can stand,
do they have enough strength left to fight?

370
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:39,480
I have a little request.

371
00:19:42,840 --> 00:19:45,260
One monster bagger, please!

372
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:54,517
uh huh now what could that
mean oh do you hear that

373
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:58,200
our boss has just ordered the
famous monster Starbarker!

374
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:22,968
I get that you guys are cheaters and
all, but can you at least try to hide it?

375
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:26,920
Does my pick go sour or sweet?

376
00:20:27,500 --> 00:20:28,794
What are the toppings?

377
00:20:29,140 --> 00:20:32,117
A head of green lettuce and
some fine yellow cheese.

378
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:36,568
Drafts between some big
pans, what do I say?

379
00:20:39,500 --> 00:20:42,520
A monster burger for me
to eat. Here it comes!

380
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:44,700
The most terrifying triple attack!

381
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:46,625
The most horrifying hamburger!

382
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:51,577
It seems hopeless for the Straw Hats,

383
00:20:51,660 --> 00:20:53,837
but I can't help but think
that the Corgi Monsters?

384
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:58,096
might get handed a red card for such
a flagrant violation of the rules.

385
00:21:01,800 --> 00:21:04,140
But looking back, what a coincidence!

386
00:21:04,500 --> 00:21:07,757
The referee just happens to be
doing some stretches right now.

387
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:10,100
Oh, well, he can't catch everything!

388
00:21:10,540 --> 00:21:13,980
I'm gonna make you turn
around! Luffy, no! Why not?

389
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:16,937
They want you to get mad so you'll
butt in and do something stupid!

390
00:21:17,020 --> 00:21:19,196
I just got a grin and fear it, Luffy.

391
00:21:19,580 --> 00:21:21,345
The preparations are complete!

392
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:24,833
All that's left now is to sit
back and enjoy the carnage!

393
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:28,780
Whatever happens from here
on out, don't blame me.

394
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:31,917
Anyway, looks like they're going
straight for the ball, man.

395
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:34,637
If I bless the axe fast,
he'll be grounded, pounded,

396
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:38,191
spliced and diced, dragged and
smashed into a burger patty.

397
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:40,270
All right, then.

398
00:21:40,353 --> 00:21:42,437
If you want a cooking battle, you got one.

399
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:45,217
Though I got to warn you, I've
never cooked scumbags before,

400
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:47,300
so I can't say how it'll turn out.

401
00:21:47,980 --> 00:21:50,760
You are mincey. Bust you up.

402
00:21:52,620 --> 00:21:53,450
Achy!

403
00:22:08,360 --> 00:22:10,760
Petyo, shoot!

404
00:22:18,740 --> 00:22:21,040
Stop crushing!

405
00:22:24,820 --> 00:22:26,000
No! Hamburg!

406
00:22:32,580 --> 00:22:34,500
You're gonna pay for that!

407
00:22:40,820 --> 00:22:41,650
Hold up, fatty.

408
00:22:41,733 --> 00:22:42,740
Forget about me.

409
00:22:43,100 --> 00:22:44,760
Out of my way, small fry!

410
00:22:45,360 --> 00:22:46,780
I'll cut you!

411
00:22:50,820 --> 00:22:51,960
No sword style.

412
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:55,030
Tatsu?

413
00:22:56,700 --> 00:22:57,530
Mock!

414
00:23:02,300 --> 00:23:03,200
Oh, no!

415
00:23:03,580 --> 00:23:04,540
Saiyan isn't so!

416
00:23:04,900 --> 00:23:08,312
Big Pan has fallen victims of
pickle-spinning-play-to-man!

417
00:23:08,560 --> 00:23:09,677
Somebody help me!

418
00:23:09,760 --> 00:23:11,054
I can't stop spinning!

419
00:23:17,520 --> 00:23:18,800
Bad Manor!

420
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:27,040
KICK COURSE!

421
00:23:30,380 --> 00:23:32,257
Head?!

422
00:23:32,340 --> 00:23:36,397
Not only did they knock Big Pan down,
they knocked him right back up too!

423
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:38,774
Although Big Pan is indeed on his feet,

424
00:23:38,860 --> 00:23:41,837
I'm not sure if he has any
idea where he's at right now!

425
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:42,750
Uh-oh!

426
00:23:42,833 --> 00:23:45,097
Now Zoro from the Straw
Hats is charging in!

427
00:23:45,180 --> 00:23:48,827
Will he be able to overtake Big
Pan in his state of confusion?

428
00:23:49,900 --> 00:23:52,020
You're not getting past me.

429
00:24:00,300 --> 00:24:01,997
I've had enough of your crap!

430
00:24:02,080 --> 00:24:03,637
And that goes for the ref too.

431
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:05,997
The crowd, or rather the ref?

432
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:08,609
Takes a direct hit from
the flying pickles!

433
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:11,260
You did that.

434
00:24:13,240 --> 00:24:14,477
On purpose.

435
00:24:14,560 --> 00:24:17,440
In your red car.

436
00:24:18,700 --> 00:24:19,760
Wait a sec.

437
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:23,380
My whistle and my cards are gone.

438
00:24:24,820 --> 00:24:26,600
You're such a naughty girl.

439
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:27,820
What can I say?

440
00:24:28,060 --> 00:24:29,440
Old habits die hard.

441
00:24:35,700 --> 00:24:37,500
Oh, this is bad.

442
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:38,798
Here they go again.

443
00:24:38,900 --> 00:24:41,757
With victory in their grasp, the
Straw Hats turn on each other.

444
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:42,980
Oh, shame.

445
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:49,280
A medallion!

446
00:24:49,660 --> 00:24:51,040
Power show!

447
00:24:56,040 --> 00:24:56,870
Incredible!

448
00:24:58,060 --> 00:25:00,380
Big Pan! What? No way!

449
00:25:03,100 --> 00:25:05,280
The massive Wu-Tan warrior!

450
00:25:06,040 --> 00:25:06,870
All right!

451
00:25:07,460 --> 00:25:09,225
They headed for the gold ring!

452
00:25:09,420 --> 00:25:10,400
It can't be!

453
00:25:26,260 --> 00:25:27,660
Goal!
